---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<Base title={`About ${SITE.brand} | Tow Dispatch in ${SITE.city}, ${SITE.state}`}
      description={`How ${SITE.brand} works: a local 24/7 dispatch service that sends licensed tow operators across Stockton, Lodi, Manteca and Tracy.`}
      path="/about/">
  <section class="s-ink">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>A local dispatch desk for San Joaquin County</h1>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">
        <p>
          {SITE.brand} is a dispatch and referral service. We do not pretend to be one big
          fleet. When you call, a dispatcher takes down where you are and what you need, then
          finds the nearest licensed independent operator with the right truck for the job.
        </p>
        <p>
          That might be a flatbed for an all-wheel-drive SUV on the Crosstown, a wheel-lift for a
          sedan in a Lodi parking lot, or a heavy wrecker for a box truck on Arch-Airport Road.
          The point is that you make one call and the right truck comes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before anything is sent, you hear the price and an estimated arrival time. If either
          one does not work for you, say so. Nothing is owed until you agree.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="figure" style="max-width:52em;">
        <img src="/img/how-dispatch-works.svg" alt="Four-step flow: you call (209) 850-ROAD, hear a quote and ETA before anything moves, the nearest licensed local operator is sent, and the job is done" width="1200" height="480" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-paper">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Why a dispatch service helps</h2>
        <p>
          Tow operators in the valley are mostly small outfits, with a few trucks each spread
          between Lodi and Tracy. At two in the morning, the one closest to you may not be the
          one whose number you happen to find. A dispatch desk keeps track of who is working and
          where, so you do not have to call around in the dark.
        </p>
        <p>
          It also means one number to remember. {SITE.phoneDisplay} spells out on any phone
          keypad, and it is the same number whether you are stuck on Highway 12 in the Delta or on
          the Altamont grade.
        </p>
        <h2>What we will not do</h2>
        <p>
          We will not quote one price and charge another. We will not invent an arrival time to
          keep you on the line. And we will tell you when you do not need a tow at all, for
          example when a jump or a spare tire will get you home.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-call" href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`}>Call {SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1.4rem; font-size:0.9rem; max-width:46em;">{SITE.legalLine}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
